  (text "Each LED sits on its own copper island (HEAT_R/G/B), never joined: slug isolation is not specified."
    (at 25.4 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "88021a4b-290f-4e51-98c1-c6b88980b34d")
  )
  (text "Wire pads: TP1/TP2 -> driver J3, TP3/TP4 -> J4, TP5/TP6 -> J5 (+ then -), 24 AWG, twisted per pair."
    (at 25.4 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "81b6f82d-11b4-4340-a8ba-956320b2690b")
  )
  (text "R, G and B name the driver's channels, whatever colour is fitted. Bought bare (D35): any 3535 LED"
    (at 25.4 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "34a7ade8-9604-48ac-b5cb-cae08560c936")
  )
  (text "with two side pads and a centre slug. The makers mark polarity differently: diode-test each type."
